---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="San Francisco Motorcycle Accidents Attorney | The Sulfab Law Office"
  description="Injured in a motorcycle accident in San Francisco? Sulfab Law Office provides aggressive legal representation for riders. Call (415) 360-5266."
>
  <section class="relative bg-dark pt-28 pb-32 overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-dark via-dark to-slate-900/80"></div>
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-16 relative z-10">
      <div class="max-w-4xl">
        <div class="w-16 h-1 bg-gold rounded-full mb-8"></div>
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-gold text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.4em] mb-6">Personal Injury</span>
        <h1 class="text-white text-5xl md:text-7xl font-bold leading-[1.05] tracking-tight mb-6">San Francisco Motorcycle Accidents Lawyer</h1>
        <p class="text-slate-400 text-xl md:text-2xl max-w-2xl leading-relaxed mb-10">Motorcycle accidents frequently result in severe injuries due to the lack of physical protection for riders. If you have been injured in a motorcycle crash caused by another driver's negligence, our firm is here to fight for you.</p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4">
          <a href="tel:+14153605266" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-3 px-8 py-4 bg-gold text-white font-black uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-xs hover:bg-amber-600 transition-all rounded-lg">Call (415) 360-5266</a>
          <a href="/#contact" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-3 px-8 py-4 border-2 border-white/25 text-white hover:border-gold hover:bg-white/5 transition-all rounded-lg">Free Case Review</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-20 bg-gradient-to-b from-white to-slate-50/50">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-16">
      <p class="text-slate-600 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6">Motorcycle accidents pose unique risks to riders. Unlike passengers in enclosed vehicles, motorcyclists have little protection from the force of impact, making serious injuries far more likely. Even a relatively low-speed collision can result in devastating harm. California's congested roadways, lane-splitting laws, and variable weather conditions add additional layers of complexity to motorcycle accident cases.</p>
      <p class="text-slate-600 text-lg leading-relaxed">At The Sulfab Law Office, we understand the unique challenges that motorcycle accident victims face. Our San Francisco motorcycle accident lawyer has extensive experience representing injured riders and their families. We know that bias against motorcyclists sometimes affects how insurance companies and juries view these cases. Our firm works tirelessly to counter that bias with strong evidence, expert testimony, and compelling advocacy designed to secure the compensation you deserve.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-16 md:py-20 border-t border-slate-100 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-16">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-[5fr_7fr] gap-16 items-start">
        <div class="lg:sticky lg:top-28">
          <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-gold text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.4em] mb-6">Experience Matters</span>
          <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-dark mb-6 italic font-serif">Dedicated Advocacy for Injured Motorcyclists</h2>
          <div class="w-16 h-1 bg-gold rounded-full"></div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6">Motorcycle accident cases require a nuanced understanding of both motorcycle dynamics and California traffic laws. Our San Francisco motorcycle accident attorney works with accident reconstruction specialists who understand motorcycle handling, braking distances, and the physics of two-vehicle collisions. We carefully document road conditions, vehicle damage, and witness statements to build a complete picture of how the accident occurred.</p>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6">Insurance companies often attempt to blame motorcyclists for their own injuries, citing assumptions about rider behavior. We proactively address these tactics by gathering evidence that demonstrates the other party's fault and the true extent of your injuries. Our goal is to ensure that you receive compensation that fully accounts for your medical expenses, lost wages, and the pain and suffering caused by the accident.</p>
          <div class="mt-8 p-6 rounded-2xl bg-amber-50/50 border border-gold/20">
            <p class="text-slate-700 font-medium">Our firm is committed to protecting the rights of motorcyclists and fighting against unfair bias to ensure that injured riders receive the full and fair compensation they deserve under California law.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-16 md:py-20 bg-slate-50/50 border-t border-slate-100">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-16">
      <div class="text-center mb-12">
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-gold text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.4em] mb-6">Common Causes</span>
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-dark mb-6 italic font-serif">Common Causes of Motorcycle Accidents</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-600 max-w-xl mx-auto">Motorcycle accidents are often caused by drivers who fail to see or yield to riders. Identifying the cause is essential to building a strong case.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-100">
          <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-red-50 text-red-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 font-bold text-sm">!</span>
          <span class="text-slate-700 text-sm font-medium">Distracted driving</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-100">
          <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-red-50 text-red-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 font-bold text-sm">!</span>
          <span class="text-slate-700 text-sm font-medium">Failure to yield to riders</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-100">
          <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-red-50 text-red-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 font-bold text-sm">!</span>
          <span class="text-slate-700 text-sm font-medium">Unsafe lane changes</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-100">
          <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-red-50 text-red-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 font-bold text-sm">!</span>
          <span class="text-slate-700 text-sm font-medium">Left-turn collisions</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-100">
          <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-red-50 text-red-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 font-bold text-sm">!</span>
          <span class="text-slate-700 text-sm font-medium">Speeding</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-100">
          <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-red-50 text-red-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 font-bold text-sm">!</span>
          <span class="text-slate-700 text-sm font-medium">Driving under the influence</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-100">
          <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-red-50 text-red-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 font-bold text-sm">!</span>
          <span class="text-slate-700 text-sm font-medium">Tailgating</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-100">
          <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-red-50 text-red-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 font-bold text-sm">!</span>
          <span class="text-slate-700 text-sm font-medium">Aggressive driving</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-100">
          <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-red-50 text-red-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 font-bold text-sm">!</span>
          <span class="text-slate-700 text-sm font-medium">Road hazards and debris</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-100">
          <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-red-50 text-red-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 font-bold text-sm">!</span>
          <span class="text-slate-700 text-sm font-medium">Defective motorcycle components</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-100">
          <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-red-50 text-red-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 font-bold text-sm">!</span>
          <span class="text-slate-700 text-sm font-medium">Poor roadway conditions</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-16 md:py-20 bg-white border-t border-slate-100">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-16">
      <div class="text-center mb-12">
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-gold text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.4em] mb-6">Common Injuries</span>
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-dark mb-6 italic font-serif">Injuries From Motorcycle Accidents</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-600 max-w-xl mx-auto">Motorcyclists are especially vulnerable to serious injuries due to the lack of protective barriers. Even with proper safety gear, riders face significant risks.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
        <div class="bg-slate-50/50 p-6 pl-8 rounded-2xl border-l-4 border-slate-200 hover:border-gold transition-all">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-dark mb-3">Traumatic Brain Injuries</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">Head injuries are among the most serious risks for motorcyclists. Even with a helmet, the force of impact can cause concussions, contusions, and severe traumatic brain injuries requiring extensive medical care.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-slate-50/50 p-6 pl-8 rounded-2xl border-l-4 border-slate-200 hover:border-gold transition-all">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-dark mb-3">Spinal Cord Injuries</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">Damage to the spinal cord from a motorcycle crash can result in partial or complete paralysis. These catastrophic injuries require lifelong medical support and significant lifestyle changes.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-slate-50/50 p-6 pl-8 rounded-2xl border-l-4 border-slate-200 hover:border-gold transition-all">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-dark mb-3">Broken Bones and Fractures</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">Motorcycle accidents commonly cause fractures to the arms, legs, collarbone, and pelvis. These injuries often require surgery, plates, screws, and months of rehabilitation.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-slate-50/50 p-6 pl-8 rounded-2xl border-l-4 border-slate-200 hover:border-gold transition-all">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-dark mb-3">Road Rash and Soft Tissue Damage</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">Skin abrasions from sliding across pavement can range from minor to severe, with deep tissue damage, nerve injury, and significant scarring that may require skin grafts and plastic surgery.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-slate-50/50 p-6 pl-8 rounded-2xl border-l-4 border-slate-200 hover:border-gold transition-all">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-dark mb-3">Internal Injuries</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">Blunt force trauma from a motorcycle collision can damage internal organs, cause internal bleeding, and lead to life-threatening complications requiring emergency surgery.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-16 md:py-20 bg-slate-50/50 border-t border-slate-100">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-16">
      <div class="text-center mb-12">
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-gold text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.4em] mb-6">Financial Recovery</span>
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-dark mb-6 italic font-serif">Compensation Available After a Motorcycle Accident</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto">Riders injured by negligent drivers may be entitled to compensation for their medical expenses, lost income, and the pain and suffering caused by the accident.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        <div class="text-center p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-100">
          <div class="inline-flex w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-amber-50 text-gold items-center justify-center mb-5">
            <svg class="w-7 h-7" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 2v20M17 5H9.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0 7h5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 7H6"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-dark mb-2">Medical Expenses</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">Coverage for emergency treatment, surgeries, hospitalization, medication, rehabilitation, and ongoing or future care related to your injuries.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="text-center p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-100">
          <div class="inline-flex w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-amber-50 text-gold items-center justify-center mb-5">
            <svg class="w-7 h-7" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"/><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-dark mb-2">Lost Wages and Earning Capacity</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">Compensation for time missed from work, lost employment benefits, and reduced future earning capacity due to permanent injuries sustained in the crash.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="text-center p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-100">
          <div class="inline-flex w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-amber-50 text-gold items-center justify-center mb-5">
            <svg class="w-7 h-7" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-dark mb-2">Pain, Suffering and Other Damages</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">Compensation for physical pain, emotional trauma, loss of enjoyment of life, and other non-economic damages caused by the motorcycle accident.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-20 bg-dark border-t border-slate-800">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-16 text-center">
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-4 italic font-serif">Contact a Motorcycle Accident Lawyer in San Francisco Today</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-400 text-lg mb-10 max-w-2xl mx-auto">If you have been injured in a motorcycle accident caused by another driver's negligence, contact Sulfab Law Office today for a free consultation.</p>
      <a href="tel:+14153605266" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-3 px-8 py-4 bg-gold text-white font-black uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-xs hover:bg-amber-600 transition-all rounded-lg">Call (415) 360-5266</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
